(text
"USB HOST_GND and HOST_RAW are isolated from system GND. See isolated_usb sheet.\nCharger DP/DM are shorted ONLY locally; USB data uses ADuM4160 to ESP32-S3.\nCharging input is enabled only for Type-C 1.5A/3A advertisement; legacy ports support battery-powered data.\n8.2V / nominal 299mA; independent insulated NTC. POWER ON holds CE high: acquisition and charge are separate modes.\nUSB power can supply the board through charger SYS and a delayed interlocked path; no unprotected BAT bypass."
